<item>
<title>Muse爆火，dots入场：Personal Agent开始和互联网平台抢入口</title>
<link>https://www.leiphone.com/category/yanxishe/Zqcw9XvSO2Ht6FIQ.html</link>
<description><![CDATA[<section data-mpa-powered-by="yiban.io" data-pm-slice="0 0 []" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible;" data-mpa-action-id="mr4k8p3w210p" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: center;" nodeleaf=""><img  class="rich_pages wxw-img js_insertlocalimg" data-aistatus="1" data-backh="104" data-backw="578" data-imgfileid="504268953" data-ratio="0.18" data-s="300,640" data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a1299d7.png" data-type="png" data-w="1000" style="width:100%;" type="block"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a1299d7.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px -10px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0px;text-align: right;line-height: 25.6px;visibility: visible;"></section></section><section style="margin-top: 16px;"><section data-mpa-powered-by="yiban.io" data-pm-slice="9 2 []" style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px 0px 24px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-family: &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: 0.544px;orphans: 2;text-align: justify;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;white-space: normal;text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);visibility: visible;" data-nest-level="2"><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;" data-nest-level="6"><section style="text-align: justify;" data-nest-level="7"><span mpa-font-style="mehvbd4zw71" style="font-size: 15px;" data-nest-level="8"><span mpa-font-style="mehvbedn59w" style="font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;" data-nest-level="9"><section data-mpa-action-id="muns4y4ic2i" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;margin-top: 24px;"><span style="font-weight: bold;font-size: 15px;" mpa-font-style="muns495b1qbv"><span mpa-font-style="muns4g2pdhp" style="font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;" mpa-font-style="muns4pinsy5"><span style="font-size: 15px;" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e193p"><span leaf="">Personal Agent，正在成为这一轮 AI 产品竞争里最热的新概念之一。</span></span></span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e1k71" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">9 月 29 日，OpenAI 发布了可以长期在线的个人 Agent 产品 dots，提出“always-on agents”。更早把这个词推到台前的是 Meta 发布的个人 Agent 产品 Muse，截至 9 月下旬下载量突破 300 万，一度将 ChatGPT 从美国 App Store 免费榜第一的位置上挤下。（雷峰网）</span></span></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;8e5a9d20-7c91-4735-ad73-57cf49cbc2c4&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:257.0625,&quot;width&quot;:457,&quot;currHeight&quot;:257.0625,&quot;currWidth&quot;:457,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:900,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.285625,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FO7xDbEuSeoroezxcpmUcKHgjntd%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;O7xDbEuSeoroezxcpmUcKHgjntd&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:902040,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a170bf1.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5625" data-type="png" data-w="1600" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1600" data-height="900" data-backw="578" data-backh="325" data-imgfileid="504274020" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a170bf1.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3e4gs" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" data-remoteid="" data-asynid="" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ACzflXDibhg5Xk26V9oqFFEaMMU5UIlsU2UnnYVDnFtq1LjVK3xruhvt2jATdTR68gBCB2hjEibWTb7tUqLYY75I7xTLeXEX9hXgEwdsHDQEY/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg" data-src="" align="" alt="" border="" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="" data-s="" data-type="png" data-w="" aria-label="" aria-braillelabel="" aria-description="" height="" hspace="" ismap="" opacity="" sizes="" style="background-color: transparent;" title="" type="" usemap="" vspace="" width="" data-width="1600" data-height="900" data-croporisrc="" data-cropx1="" data-cropx2="" data-cropy1="" data-cropy2="" data-cropselx1="" data-cropselx2="" data-cropsely1="" data-cropsely2="" data-backw="" data-backh="" data-copyright="" data-oversubscription-url="" data-before-oversubscription-url="" data-galleryid="" data-gallerysupplier="" data-cardimg="" data-fileid="" data-imgfileid="504274002" data-positionback="" data-imgqrcoded="" data-imgid="" data-upload="" data-fromlib="" data-aiimageid="" data-aiimagesource="" data-cacheurl="" data-retry="" data-ignore-width=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Muse 运行在一台独立的云端虚拟电脑里，有自己的浏览器，可以替用户打开网页、填写表格、发邮件、预订旅行；一些耗时更长的任务，即使用户退出 App，它也可以继续在后台执行。扎克伯格举过用 Muse 爬山预约的例子：</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">任务可以跨几天甚至几周持续存在。</span></span></strong></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3elsk" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Muse 之后，这条路线很快开始变得拥挤。9 月 28 日，Manus 推出一款名为 Cue 的独立应用。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;23d0bc34-a596-43a0-be90-38f9eb8cf3f8&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:303,&quot;width&quot;:404,&quot;currHeight&quot;:303,&quot;currWidth&quot;:404,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:510,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:680,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.5941176470588235,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FDxQ1bYJP4o3x5Px7pbMc4pssnLD%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;DxQ1bYJP4o3x5Px7pbMc4pssnLD&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:451230,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a1afbc3.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.75" data-type="png" data-w="680" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="680" data-height="510" data-backw="578" data-backh="434" data-imgfileid="504274018" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a1afbc3.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3e1cgk" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><strong data-remoteid="" data-asynid="" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ACzflXDibhg5zPWSiaTDiaV7Qh1RZ81zITHMt1y51QZ0qgwdicqzGt94gibQ3aC2QEBSFK4OHGu0zebqyCjRV5IXWWkCGJO3Sw6iasI2fibf7Xwgibo/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg" data-src="" align="" alt="" border="" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="" data-s="" data-type="png" data-w="" aria-label="" aria-braillelabel="" aria-description="" height="" hspace="" ismap="" opacity="" sizes="" style="background-color: transparent;" title="" type="" usemap="" vspace="" width="" data-width="680" data-height="510" data-croporisrc="" data-cropx1="" data-cropx2="" data-cropy1="" data-cropy2="" data-cropselx1="" data-cropselx2="" data-cropsely1="" data-cropsely2="" data-backw="" data-backh="" data-copyright="" data-oversubscription-url="" data-before-oversubscription-url="" data-galleryid="" data-gallerysupplier="" data-cardimg="" data-fileid="" data-imgfileid="504274001" data-positionback="" data-imgqrcoded="" data-imgid="" data-upload="" data-fromlib="" data-aiimageid="" data-aiimagesource="" data-cacheurl="" data-retry="" data-ignore-width=""><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">国内大厂也开始往同一个方向靠拢。</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">千问宣布加速打造 Personal Agent；豆包早在今年 4 月就启动了代号 Spell 的 Personal Agent 项目，Muse 走红后字节进一步加速推进，计划 9 月底完成体验版测试。腾讯也被曝正在内测代号 Handy Bot 的 Personal Agent，并计划推出独立 App。</span></span><span data-mpa-action-id="munsdnsw1u6a"></span></span></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;2742ea3c-1396-4dc7-b0aa-f2b14919b9f0&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:304,&quot;width&quot;:456,&quot;currHeight&quot;:304,&quot;currWidth&quot;:456,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:720,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1080,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.4222222222222222,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FDTmxbnrWvoCkExxFwvqcLvfbngc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;DTmxbnrWvoCkExxFwvqcLvfbngc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:365816,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a1e72bf.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.6666666666666666" data-type="png" data-w="1080" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1080" data-height="720" data-backw="578" data-backh="385" data-imgfileid="504274017" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a1e72bf.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3ez6k" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" data-remoteid="" data-asynid="" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ACzflXDibhg6TJg3P0kV3nfksB21WwHvUX5v3ggxobbAODXAQkmSJqVO1Rpq3cZsZ18wOTJGmtU0BBk6Do5PBoDWOYwK8IEXaHtdzcjw4SeI/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg" data-src="" align="" alt="" border="" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="" data-s="" data-type="png" data-w="" aria-label="" aria-braillelabel="" aria-description="" height="" hspace="" ismap="" opacity="" sizes="" style="background-color: transparent;" title="" type="" usemap="" vspace="" width="" data-width="1080" data-height="720" data-croporisrc="" data-cropx1="" data-cropx2="" data-cropy1="" data-cropy2="" data-cropselx1="" data-cropselx2="" data-cropsely1="" data-cropsely2="" data-backw="" data-backh="" data-copyright="" data-oversubscription-url="" data-before-oversubscription-url="" data-galleryid="" data-gallerysupplier="" data-cardimg="" data-fileid="" data-imgfileid="504274000" data-positionback="" data-imgqrcoded="" data-imgid="" data-upload="" data-fromlib="" data-aiimageid="" data-aiimagesource="" data-cacheurl="" data-retry="" data-ignore-width=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">不到一个月，Muse、Cue、千问，以及更多正在跟进的产品，把 Personal Agent 从一个产品概念推成了新的竞争方向。问题也随之出现：过去两年 Agent 已经火过很多轮，</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">为什么现在 Personal Agent 突然集中出现？以及这些公司想竞争的到底是什么？</span></span></strong></span><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="94063" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="padding-top: 10px;padding-bottom: 10px;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;display: inline-block;"><section data-bgless="spin" data-bglessp="280" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: -22px;outline: 0px;height: 8px;background: rgb(238, 92, 47);border-radius: 6px;overflow: hidden;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-right: auto;margin-left: auto;padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;outline: 0px;display: inline-block;height: 35px;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);line-height: 35px;font-size: 30px;transform: rotate(0deg);"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;" mpa-is-content="t"><span leaf="">01</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></section></section></section><h4 style="outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.6em;"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;visibility: visible;"><span style="outline: 0px;color: #EE5B2E;visibility: visible;" mpa-is-content="t"><span leaf="">Personal Agent 围绕“人”建立 Context</span></span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></h4></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e10gx" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Personal Agent 为什么在这个时间点集中爆发？我们可以从以下三个方面理解。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3edr" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">首先，是场景成熟度。</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">过去一段时间，Codex、WorkBuddy 这类办公 Agent 已经把“AI 能真正替用户做事”推向了主流。用户愿意交给 Agent 的任务正在变得越来越重。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3e12xq" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">其次，是用户需求的变化。</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Assistant Benchmark 创始人 David Pawlan 指出，市场上已有 122 款不同类型的 Agent 产品，日常高频场景集中在邮件归类、表单填写和代理协作事项上。这些需求有一个共同特征：用户希望产品长期记住自己的状态、习惯和偏好，替自己长期管理某件事。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3ei6o" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">最后，是技术可行性。</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">支撑长期记忆和后台执行的技术，在这半年里集中走向工程可用。过去 Agent 一旦跨天、跨周，容易出现信息衰减、关键上下文丢失和任务跑偏；现在这些问题开始被长期 Memory、云端执行环境和后台任务机制逐步缓解。</span></span></span></section><blockquote><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e15cw" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">但长期理解一个人，和完成一个明确任务，是两种不同的工作方式。</span></span></section></blockquote><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3e8wd" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">办公 Agent 通常围绕</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">任务</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">工作。任务很明确，比如要修一个项目 Bug，就读取相关代码、报错和测试文件，这是它工作的上下文，一项任务结束，这组 Context 的作用也基本结束。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;99d8fe58-aee2-4355-9b81-b2cd00b17f85&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:408.75,&quot;width&quot;:545,&quot;currHeight&quot;:408.75,&quot;currWidth&quot;:545,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1086,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1448,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.3763812154696133,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FK0dZbApw4oAaEIxIl5GczPZXnFc%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;K0dZbApw4oAaEIxIl5GczPZXnFc&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1628676,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a241674.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.75" data-type="png" data-w="1448" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1448" data-height="1086" data-backw="578" data-backh="434" data-imgfileid="504274021" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a241674.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong data-remoteid="" data-asynid="" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ACzflXDibhg6knbryibXiaFx6TZaK78ToPJMDJTnhCJFpaaS0yU2oEEib8Ej6J6YWeyZTCylXfAZE43MechHIy9fwiaUuwpexhvBSdIjGFlro1Is/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg" data-src="" align="" alt="" border="" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="" data-s="" data-type="png" data-w="" aria-label="" aria-braillelabel="" aria-description="" height="" hspace="" ismap="" opacity="" sizes="" style="background-color: transparent;font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;" title="" type="" usemap="" vspace="" width="" data-width="1448" data-height="1086" data-croporisrc="" data-cropx1="" data-cropx2="" data-cropy1="" data-cropy2="" data-cropselx1="" data-cropselx2="" data-cropsely1="" data-cropsely2="" data-backw="" data-backh="" data-copyright="" data-oversubscription-url="" data-before-oversubscription-url="" data-galleryid="" data-gallerysupplier="" data-cardimg="" data-fileid="" data-imgfileid="504274003" data-positionback="" data-imgqrcoded="" data-imgid="" data-upload="" data-fromlib="" data-aiimageid="" data-aiimagesource="" data-cacheurl="" data-retry="" data-ignore-width="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e1wt4"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">办公 Agent 主要管理任务状态，Personal Agent 则试图长期管理一个人的状态。</span></span></strong></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e1kpi" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">很多时候，用户的想法还比较模糊，告诉它的可能只是“下个月想出去玩几天”“最近想把生活规律一点”“这笔花费是不是还能更便宜”。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3ekfv" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">正在做 Personal Agent 的创业者林周告诉雷峰网，他们早期的产品更像“一句话生成一个小应用”，但很快发现，只要用户没有明确想法，Agent 就很难继续提供价值。后来产品开始转向长期记住用户状态、习惯和偏好，再判断下一步需要什么。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3ehso" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这也决定了Personal Agent 的 Context 很难只围绕一项任务建立，它要逐渐围绕用户本人组织起来。</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">它不仅要知道这次要订酒店，还可能需要知道用户过去住什么样的酒店、不喜欢什么航班、预算大概多少；一件事情隔了几天甚至几周，也不能因为对话结束就重新从零开始。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e1t2h" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">因此，Memory在 Personal Agent 里最困难的是从大量个人信息中持续判断：个人偏好中哪些是真的和眼前的任务相关的，要排除掉哪些一次例外、过期的信息。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3eabf" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">另一层差别发生在</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">执行端</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e13tf" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">办公 Agent 通常面对的是相对固定的工具集合：代码库、终端、文件系统和企业 API；Personal Agent 却需要根据用户需求在不同服务之间做选择，再跨浏览器、邮箱、日历、电话和支付等环境把任务接着做下去。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3ep51" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">也因此，Muse 给 Agent 配独立的云端电脑和浏览器，Cue 更进一步给 Agent 配上邮箱、电话号码、钱包和电脑。Manus 创始人肖弘在网络平台上把这种产品形态描述得更进一步：“……</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">也许可以称之为人</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">……”</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;76934517-0903-4ae3-aa80-d546fae03d8d&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:168.4563419117647,&quot;width&quot;:507,&quot;currHeight&quot;:168.4563419117647,&quot;currWidth&quot;:507,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:723,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:2176,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.23299632352941177,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FLntHblLiJosSZ0xlMA0cbFPZnqg%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;LntHblLiJosSZ0xlMA0cbFPZnqg&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1384689,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a278a7b.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.3322610294117647" data-type="png" data-w="2176" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="2176" data-height="723" data-backw="578" data-backh="192" data-imgfileid="504274019" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a278a7b.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3e2255" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" data-remoteid="" data-asynid="" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ACzflXDibhg7Iwm2abaVONDL5wSxxgRaCQP6as0jn34thJPpHVUKEoKuMGLmtctZicgIoSVfR2vRR1gniaHtNhKgAjkK1yXibLNNFkf04rgNr2Y/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg" data-src="" align="" alt="" border="" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="" data-s="" data-type="png" data-w="" aria-label="" aria-braillelabel="" aria-description="" height="" hspace="" ismap="" opacity="" sizes="" style="background-color: transparent;" title="" type="" usemap="" vspace="" width="" data-width="2176" data-height="723" data-croporisrc="" data-cropx1="" data-cropx2="" data-cropy1="" data-cropy2="" data-cropselx1="" data-cropselx2="" data-cropsely1="" data-cropsely2="" data-backw="" data-backh="" data-copyright="" data-oversubscription-url="" data-before-oversubscription-url="" data-galleryid="" data-gallerysupplier="" data-cardimg="" data-fileid="" data-imgfileid="504274007" data-positionback="" data-imgqrcoded="" data-imgid="" data-upload="" data-fromlib="" data-aiimageid="" data-aiimagesource="" data-cacheurl="" data-retry="" data-ignore-width=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这些设计背后的方向是一致的：</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">让 Agent 成为一个可以长期存在、跨服务行动的执行层。</span></span></strong></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3elx8" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">两类 Agent 的差别也因此不只是“办公”和“生活”。办公 Agent 更关心如何把一个明确任务做完，Personal Agent 则试图长期理解用户，并在不同时间、不同服务之间把事情接着做下去。</span></span><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="94063" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="padding-top: 10px;padding-bottom: 10px;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;display: inline-block;"><section data-bgless="spin" data-bglessp="280" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: -22px;outline: 0px;height: 8px;background: rgb(238, 92, 47);border-radius: 6px;overflow: hidden;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-right: auto;margin-left: auto;padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;outline: 0px;display: inline-block;height: 35px;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);line-height: 35px;font-size: 30px;transform: rotate(0deg);"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;" mpa-is-content="t"><span leaf="">02</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></section></section></section><h4 style="outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.6em;"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;visibility: visible;"><span style="outline: 0px;color: #EE5B2E;visibility: visible;" mpa-is-content="t"><span leaf="">Personal Agent 想抢在用户选择平台之前</span></span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></h4></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3elub" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">过去二十年，互联网平台长期争夺的是用户注意力和流量入口。谁能让用户先进入自己的平台，谁就更有机会掌握后面的搜索、推荐、广告和交易。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3ek1y" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">过去，一个人想买一台咖啡机，会先打开淘宝，再搜索、筛选、比较。如果换成 Personal Agent，用户只需要说一句：“帮我买一台 1000 元以内、明天能到、评价不错的咖啡机。”在淘宝或Amazon真正被打开之前，Agent 已经知道了他的需求、预算和时间要求。</span></span></section><blockquote><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3e1tg0" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">过去的链路是：</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">用户 → 平台 → 服务。</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Personal Agent 想把它改成：</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">用户 → Agent → 平台 / 服务。</span></span></strong></span></section></blockquote><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e8pa" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">正在做 Personal Agent 的创业者林周告诉雷峰网，他们现在会让 Agent 长期追踪用户的状态，再主动判断什么时候应该介入。比如一个人持续健身一段时间后，Agent 不必等用户重新来问，可以根据此前的计划和状态主动给出下一步建议。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3exnh" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这也正是Personal Agent 想占据的，比注意力更靠前的一层东西。我们可以把这种逻辑称之为：</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Intent Economy，意图经济。</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">谁先拿到用户意图，就开始拥有替用户选择服务的分发权。用户已经产生需求，但还没有决定去哪个平台。</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这也是它和互联网平台原有的入口和分发权发生重叠的地方。</span></span></strong></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3eul5" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">要做到这一步，光有一个会操作网页的通用 Agent 还不够，它还需要 Connector。Connector 可以简单理解成 Agent 和外部服务之间的“接口”。它可以把用户日常使用的服务接进来，用户授权后，Agent 可以读取邮件、日历、商品和订单，并在权限范围内执行操作，这也是 Personal Agent 和通用 Agent 一个主要的差异点。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3eby3" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Meta 最近围绕 Muse 快速扩展 Connectors，把零售、支付、旅行、办公等服务接到 Agent 后面，包括 Walmart、PayPal、Expedia、Notion 等。换句话说，</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Muse 正在尝试搭建一张 Agent 可以直接调用的服务网络。</span></span></strong></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3ewke" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">也就是说，Personal Agent 真正想争夺的不只是用户需求的第一入口，而是需求之后的</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">服务分配权</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">。问题在于，这种分配权并不是 Agent 单方面就能获得的。</span></span></span><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="94063" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="padding-top: 10px;padding-bottom: 10px;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;display: inline-block;"><section data-bgless="spin" data-bglessp="280" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: -22px;outline: 0px;height: 8px;background: rgb(238, 92, 47);border-radius: 6px;overflow: hidden;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-right: auto;margin-left: auto;padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;outline: 0px;display: inline-block;height: 35px;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);line-height: 35px;font-size: 30px;transform: rotate(0deg);"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;" mpa-is-content="t"><span leaf="">03</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></section></section></section><h4 style="outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.6em;"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;visibility: visible;"><span style="outline: 0px;color: #EE5B2E;visibility: visible;" mpa-is-content="t"><span leaf="">Agent 想成为入口，巨头还守着门</span></span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></h4></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3e1etu" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Personal Agent 的产品叙事里，互联网像一个可以自由调用的巨大工具箱。用户给出目标，Agent 自己去搜索、比较、调用不同服务，最后把事情做完。但真正开始执行以后，它很快会碰到一个问题：</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">用户愿意让 Agent 去，并不意味着平台愿意让 Agent 进。</span></span></strong></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e89r" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Muse 和 Amazon 的冲突就是一个很例子。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e21m9" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Muse 上线后可以替用户在不同网站搜索和购物，但 Amazon 很快阻止了它访问自己的购物网站。Amazon 给出的理由是 Muse 没有事先获得许可，并强调第三方 Agent 应当公开自己的身份，同时尊重服务提供方是否愿意参与的决定。Amazon 此前也对 OpenAI、Google 等公司的购物 Agent 采取过类似限制。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e11zp" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这件事也暴露出了 Personal Agent 入口逻辑里的一个缺口。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3e22cu" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">用户可以授权 Muse 替自己购物，但在平台看来，Agent 是谁、代表谁、能读取什么数据、出了问题由谁负责，仍然要由平台自己的规则决定。换句话说，Personal Agent 面前其实有两道授权：</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">第一道来自用户，我允许你代表我行动；第二道来自平台，我是否承认你可以这样进入。</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">只有用户授权，Agent 即使知道用户想做什么，也未必真的能把事情做完。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e1th" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">只有用户授权，Agent 能理解用户想做什么，却未必真的做得成。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e1jpk" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Amazon 的态度就很典型：它限制站在消费者前面的第三方 Agent，却同时在卖家业务中增加 Agentic AI 能力。区别在于，后者仍然服务于 Amazon 自己的工作流；而当 Personal Agent 先拿到用户需求，再决定是否调用 Amazon 时，它已经开始介入平台原本掌握的入口和分发。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3ervh" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Shopify 给出的则是另一种答案。它没有简单把第三方 Agent 当成一个未经邀请的自动化程序，而是开始把 ChatGPT、Gemini、Microsoft Copilot、Meta 等 AI 产品正式纳入 Agentic Storefronts，让商家决定自己的商品是否进入这些渠道，并由 Shopify 继续承担商品、订单和结账等基础设施。这可能更接近未来平台与 Agent 的关系：</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">平台不会放弃规则制定权，它会把 Agent 纳入自己的规则。</span></span></strong></span></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;df736f10-106d-40d4-99eb-8d7ff4e84924&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:261,&quot;width&quot;:464,&quot;currHeight&quot;:261,&quot;currWidth&quot;:464,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:675,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1200,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.38666666666666666,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FJjuobRla7oYH7vxXoeecxu2en2f%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;JjuobRla7oYH7vxXoeecxu2en2f&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:665742,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a2bb9f5.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.5625" data-type="png" data-w="1200" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1200" data-height="675" data-backw="578" data-backh="325" data-imgfileid="504274023" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a2bb9f5.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3e17fg" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf="" data-remoteid="" data-asynid="" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ACzflXDibhg5ml88sFQg1PuP1DQGica2ls80GWXHG1ommTyDS6ice9XUgZCXrZrt0NMHjiaAIsdo6Iugyxxib0icE12dqKh5Zk5FQF8urXicMaBJ7U/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg" data-src="" align="" alt="" border="" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="" data-s="" data-type="png" data-w="" aria-label="" aria-braillelabel="" aria-description="" height="" hspace="" ismap="" opacity="" sizes="" style="background-color: transparent;" title="" type="" usemap="" vspace="" width="" data-width="1200" data-height="675" data-croporisrc="" data-cropx1="" data-cropx2="" data-cropy1="" data-cropy2="" data-cropselx1="" data-cropselx2="" data-cropsely1="" data-cropsely2="" data-backw="" data-backh="" data-copyright="" data-oversubscription-url="" data-before-oversubscription-url="" data-galleryid="" data-gallerysupplier="" data-cardimg="" data-fileid="" data-imgfileid="504274005" data-positionback="" data-imgqrcoded="" data-imgid="" data-upload="" data-fromlib="" data-aiimageid="" data-aiimagesource="" data-cacheurl="" data-retry="" data-ignore-width=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">从搜索爬虫、第三方 App 到小程序，新中间层出现后，平台最终都会建立自己的访问规则。Personal Agent 很可能也一样：身份认证、官方 Connector、支付和关键操作确认，会逐渐被标准化。Agent 拿到用户需求，并不意味着天然拿到了整个互联网的分发权。需要重新定义的是：</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">当一个 AI 声称自己代表用户时，平台在什么条件下承认这种代理关系。</span></span></strong></span><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="94063" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="padding-top: 10px;padding-bottom: 10px;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;display: inline-block;"><section data-bgless="spin" data-bglessp="280" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: -22px;outline: 0px;height: 8px;background: rgb(238, 92, 47);border-radius: 6px;overflow: hidden;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-right: auto;margin-left: auto;padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;outline: 0px;display: inline-block;height: 35px;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);line-height: 35px;font-size: 30px;transform: rotate(0deg);"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;" mpa-is-content="t"><span leaf="">04</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></section></section></section><h4 style="outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.6em;"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;visibility: visible;"><span style="outline: 0px;color: #EE5B2E;visibility: visible;" mpa-is-content="t"><span leaf="">Personal Agent 离“下一代入口”还差什么？</span></span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></h4></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e173w" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">如果只看最近一个月的产品发布和融资节奏，Personal Agent 很容易给人一种“下一代入口已经出现”的感觉。但它离这条路线离真正成立还有距离。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3e1e3t" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">首先，它没有明显的底层技术跃迁。</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Muse、Cue 依赖的浏览器自动化、Container、长期记忆、工具调用和后台任务，此前都已经存在，开发者也早就可以把这些能力拼成自己的 Agent。Muse 真正的变化更像是工程和产品层面的：把云端电脑、浏览器、Memory、权限和工具调用这套过去需要开发者自己拼起来的东西，做成普通用户可以直接使用的产品。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;e296d1c4-da8f-40c3-a734-81f92c2af35f&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:303.75,&quot;width&quot;:405,&quot;currHeight&quot;:303.75,&quot;currWidth&quot;:405,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:1086,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:1448,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.2796961325966851,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FVG9tbpzQnozhS4xEnzOcSSYOnfs%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;VG9tbpzQnozhS4xEnzOcSSYOnfs&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:1490853,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a31d282.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.75" data-type="png" data-w="1448" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="1448" data-height="1086" data-backw="578" data-backh="434" data-imgfileid="504274024" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a31d282.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" data-remoteid="" data-asynid="" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ACzflXDibhg7U9qCNjiaqOehOL6ibNgoS8qkPGvVicqDazQS1zUq5wZwNCdIhFGRicBVnsq42r17nmseZFpqibW6qw6Cmiab3aAJIhUNoLVC0lwMQ8/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg" data-src="" align="" alt="" border="" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="" data-s="" data-type="png" data-w="" aria-label="" aria-braillelabel="" aria-description="" height="" hspace="" ismap="" opacity="" sizes="" style="background-color: transparent;font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;" title="" type="" usemap="" vspace="" width="" data-width="1448" data-height="1086" data-croporisrc="" data-cropx1="" data-cropx2="" data-cropy1="" data-cropy2="" data-cropselx1="" data-cropselx2="" data-cropsely1="" data-cropsely2="" data-backw="" data-backh="" data-copyright="" data-oversubscription-url="" data-before-oversubscription-url="" data-galleryid="" data-gallerysupplier="" data-cardimg="" data-fileid="" data-imgfileid="504274008" data-positionback="" data-imgqrcoded="" data-imgid="" data-upload="" data-fromlib="" data-aiimageid="" data-aiimagesource="" data-cacheurl="" data-retry="" data-ignore-width="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e6bh"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这也是为什么今天跑得最顺的场景仍然是退款退货和购物比价：目标明确，出错后也大多可以补救。它距离“长期理解一个人并替他处理生活”，还有很长距离。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3e13ab" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">再往前，一个更难的问题是用户愿意把多少行动权交给 AI。</span></span></strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">扎克伯格举过一个例子：如果 Muse 知道用户怀孕，它可以据此推荐无酒精饮品更好的餐厅，但不应该把“怀孕”这件事告诉餐厅。Meta 把这种能力叫“分寸感”。Agent 知道得越多，这种判断反而越重要。</span></span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><strong mpa-font-style="muns4y3enw7" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">到了中国，还会多上一层平台的限制。</span></span></strong></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e1dpk" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">海外的 Personal Agent，很大程度建立在 Email、Web、Calendar、信用卡这些相对开放的基础设施上；而中国用户的很多数字生活，都沉淀在微信、淘宝、美团、抖音、小红书这样的超级 App 里。社交、支付、交易和本地生活服务，都深嵌在各自生态内部，并不天然向一个独立的第三方 Agent 开放。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;line-height: 1.75em;" data-type="image" data-ace-gallery-json="{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;6d301f59-4bf1-4d69-9e63-3f822be14421&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:122,&quot;width&quot;:400,&quot;currHeight&quot;:122,&quot;currWidth&quot;:400,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:122,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:400,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:1,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream.feishu.cn%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FCcNmb4d8loJow7xEEVdciitzn4g%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;CcNmb4d8loJow7xEEVdciitzn4g&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:46048,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a342f81.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="0.305" data-type="png" data-w="400" style="background-color: transparent;width: 100%;" data-width="400" data-height="122" data-backw="400" data-backh="122" data-imgfileid="504274022" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a342f81.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" data-remoteid="" data-asynid="" src="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ACzflXDibhg5Rn0ibJfQ57SlAdjPu8FnxfIGiaDaaMgklOKhibu5k66QM5VhHR1zuUJGjibWXgw53tcKtWeRACegiaibzKMK0PYoCujmZPiarxKU8bg/0?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg" data-src="" align="" alt="" border="" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="" data-s="" data-type="png" data-w="" aria-label="" aria-braillelabel="" aria-description="" height="" hspace="" ismap="" opacity="" sizes="" style="background-color: transparent;font-size: 12px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;" title="" type="" usemap="" vspace="" width="" data-width="400" data-height="122" data-croporisrc="" data-cropx1="" data-cropx2="" data-cropy1="" data-cropy2="" data-cropselx1="" data-cropselx2="" data-cropsely1="" data-cropsely2="" data-backw="" data-backh="" data-copyright="" data-oversubscription-url="" data-before-oversubscription-url="" data-galleryid="" data-gallerysupplier="" data-cardimg="" data-fileid="" data-imgfileid="504274006" data-positionback="" data-imgqrcoded="" data-imgid="" data-upload="" data-fromlib="" data-aiimageid="" data-aiimagesource="" data-cacheurl="" data-retry="" data-ignore-width="" mpa-font-style="munsfus16gk" data-mpa-action-id="munsfusk1920" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;color: #888888;">（Muse的通知消息：它会主动让用户把“在别的 AI 那里说过的背景信息”再发给自己）</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e1e3a" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这也带来一个尴尬的局面：最有条件把这些服务串起来的，恰恰是平台自己。腾讯有微信和小程序，阿里有电商、支付、地图和旅行，字节也有内容、电商和本地生活。但如果一个 Agent 最后主要活动在自家体系里，它究竟是用户的 Agent，还是平台新的入口形式，就很难说了。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3e1w4e" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">所以今天限制 Personal Agent 的，已经不只是模型够不够聪明。它至少还要同时跨过三道门槛：</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">任务能不能连续跑几天而不掉链子，用户敢不敢让它真的替自己做决定，以及平台是否愿意把关键服务交给一个外部 Agent。</span></span></strong></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3eb66" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">这三件事，目前都还没有被彻底解决。</span></span><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: 24px;outline: 0px;color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size: 17px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-align: justify;"><section data-role="title" data-tools="135编辑器" data-id="94063" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;"><section hm_fix="374:463" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="padding-top: 10px;padding-bottom: 10px;outline: 0px;text-align: center;"><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;display: inline-block;"><section data-bgless="spin" data-bglessp="280" mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-bottom: -22px;outline: 0px;height: 8px;background: rgb(238, 92, 47);border-radius: 6px;overflow: hidden;margin-top: 24px;"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" style="margin-right: auto;margin-left: auto;padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;outline: 0px;display: inline-block;height: 35px;color: rgb(63, 63, 63);line-height: 35px;font-size: 30px;transform: rotate(0deg);"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;" mpa-is-content="t"><span leaf="">05</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></section></section></section><h4 style="outline: 0px;font-weight: 400;font-size: 16px;text-align: center;visibility: visible;letter-spacing: 0.544px;line-height: 1.6em;"><strong mpa-from-tpl="t" style="outline: 0px;visibility: visible;"><span style="outline: 0px;color: #EE5B2E;visibility: visible;" mpa-is-content="t"><span leaf="">新故事，还是新入口？</span></span><span leaf=""><br/></span></strong></h4></section></section></section></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4y3e1b88" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">Personal Agent 之所以迅速升温，一个很直接的原因是，</span></span><strong><span leaf=""><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">它被不少从业者视为接下来最具确定性的方向。</span></span></strong></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3ebe4" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">相比 AI 办公，Personal Agent 面向的是一个人的整个数字生活。Muse 出现以后，很多人的反应是“终于等到了！”这种确定性，大厂已经用行动投了票。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e1vy0" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">但另一面也很明显：Personal Agent 的热度，本身也符合这一轮 AI 行业对“新故事”的需要。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e1aha" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">过去两年行业谈参数、Token、API 和企业收入；Personal Agent 出现以后，下载量、DAU、入口、生态、交易和分发这些消费互联网熟悉的词又回来了。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" mpa-font-style="muns4y3e1gd6" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;">故事成立，不等于产品已经成立。长期 Memory、用户对交易控制权的让渡、平台开放，以及高推理成本下的商业模式，都还没有真正解决。所以 Personal Agent 最后未必会以一个独立 App 的形态存在，它也可能直接长进手机系统、超级 App 和已有的 AI 助手里。</span></span></section><section style="text-align: justify;margin-bottom: 24px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span mpa-font-style="muns4g2p10ef" style="font-size: 15px;font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;"><span style="letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: &quot;mp-quote&quot;, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;PingFang SC&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;" mpa-font-style="muns4pin1y8z"><span leaf="">但有一点已经越来越清楚：AI 正在从完成一次任务，走向长期代表用户行动。过去互联网争的是用户先打开谁的 App，Personal Agent 想争的，是用户打开 App 之前的那一步。谁能成为用户和互联网之间新的中间层，已经开始成为下一轮竞争的位置。</span></span></span></section></section></span></span></section></section></section><section style="text-align: center;margin-bottom: 0px;margin-top: 32px;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a39e640.png" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.228" data-s="300,640" data-type="png" data-w="1000" style="width: 100%;background-color: transparent;" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/ACzflXDibhg6C8UmqqoQOMGibSRhH3FqicIyxZ5YONZp46R6gvqLe9qFRbc8pIxXbNXgmYTcg1UhNqOWXA9c5m8TXBSeux18qRvEqIT6LeHWT8/0?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="578" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="710" data-backw="578" data-backh="710" data-imgfileid="504272802" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a39e640.png?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section></section><section mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mr38q9h31fs1" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section data-mpa-template="t" mpa-data-temp-power-by="yiban.io" mpa-data-temp-type="historyRecommend" mpa-from-tpl="t" data-mpa-action-id="mr38qm3y1knu" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="font-size: 16px;white-space: normal;display: flex;color: rgb(224, 98, 43);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);justify-content: center;align-items: center;user-select: text !important;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><section style="font-size: 12px;line-height: 1.6em;text-align: center;user-select: text !important;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">▼</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section style="padding-right: 10px;padding-left: 10px;line-height: 1.6em;letter-spacing: 1px;text-align: center;user-select: text !important;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">推荐阅读</span><span leaf=""><br/></span></section><section style="font-size: 12px;line-height: 1.6em;text-align: center;user-select: text !important;" mpa-from-tpl="t"><span leaf="">▼</span></section></section></section><section style="-webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;letter-spacing: 0.544px;visibility: visible;" data-mpa-action-id="mqp1n1o01w6w" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section><span leaf=""><br/></span></section></section><section data-recommend-type="list-normal" data-recommend-tid="2" data-mpa-template="t" style="width: 100%;display: flex;justify-content: center;align-items: center;" data-mid="" data-from="yb-recommend" data-mpa-action-id="muns2kx4u3r" data-pm-slice="0 0 []"><section style="width: 100%;padding: 14px 7px 6px;background: #ffffff;border-radius: 3px;border: 1px solid #e8e8eb;" data-mid=""><section data-mpa-template="t" data-recommend-article-type="list-normal" data-recomment-template-id="2" data-recommend-article-id="1000007473_1" data-recommend-article-time="1788233842" data-recommend-article-cover="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ACzflXDibhg7dW5Ru4I2S2QXcYTp7eWfxO6SicMvv0NpIa2AqKQzicVBtJaiaK7icJuvMl3O9JK0GexZP8ibvMZ8ICPsZKRYvNCgz9orBEME9jaa0/0?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-recommend-article-title="流沙之上：陈冕、景鲲、倪正民和中国 AI 应用创业者的三种选择" data-recommend-article-content-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/mXLmov60NG_-zyvcuh1H_Q"><section data-recommend-content="t" style="width: 100%;padding: 5px 10px;background: #f9f9f9;border-radius: 3px;border: 1px solid #efefef;margin-bottom: 8px;display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: center;" data-mid=""><section style="margin-right: 12px;flex: 1;" data-mid=""><p data-recommend-title="t" style="font-size: 13px;font-weight: 400;color: #333333;line-height: 18px;margin-bottom: 20px;max-width: 100%;overflow: hidden;display: -webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp: 2;-webkit-box-orient: vertical;" data-mid=""><span leaf=""><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MTM2ODM0ODYyMQ==&mid=2651755778&idx=1&sn=01abec0b5dd8be6b66f3c26d55f32b28&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span textstyle="" style="color: #333333;">流沙之上：陈冕、景鲲、倪正民和中国 AI 应用创业者的三种选择</span></a></span></p><p data-recommend-date="t" style="max-width: 100%;font-size: 11px;font-weight: 400;color: #999999;line-height: 16px;" data-mid=""><span leaf="">2026-09-01</span></p></section><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MTM2ODM0ODYyMQ==&mid=2651755778&idx=1&sn=01abec0b5dd8be6b66f3c26d55f32b28&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span leaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a3bcb05.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-w="382" style="width: 51px;object-fit: cover;height: 51px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a3bcb05.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></span></a></section></section><section data-mpa-template="t" data-recommend-article-type="list-normal" data-recomment-template-id="2" data-recommend-article-id="1000007521_1" data-recommend-article-time="1789711200" data-recommend-article-cover="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ACzflXDibhg6zB7PciaL1hs0OGUpEIFDl272oSEHQxdNaxicwks4b0MWIeqrPcMhZ5DCxAlgQMyGZTMPkIGicVgWfFWPEuLEAKNVHDfOYdPQsjg/0?wx_fmt=jpeg" data-recommend-article-title="WorkBuddy、豆包工作、千问办公实测：AI 把活干完了，为什么你更累了？" data-recommend-article-content-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/ZpVr4SpYO9LgBdVub9ji7w"><section data-recommend-content="t" style="width: 100%;padding: 5px 10px;background: #f9f9f9;border-radius: 3px;border: 1px solid #efefef;margin-bottom: 8px;display: flex;justify-content: space-between;align-items: center;" data-mid=""><section style="margin-right: 12px;flex: 1;" data-mid=""><p data-recommend-title="t" style="font-size: 13px;font-weight: 400;color: #333333;line-height: 18px;margin-bottom: 20px;max-width: 100%;overflow: hidden;display: -webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp: 2;-webkit-box-orient: vertical;" data-mid=""><span leaf=""><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MTM2ODM0ODYyMQ==&mid=2651757098&idx=1&sn=cd31781e4f3ac110928f0b766120d051&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span textstyle="" style="color: #333333;">WorkBuddy、豆包工作、千问办公实测：AI 把活干完了，为什么你更累了？</span></a></span></p><p data-recommend-date="t" style="max-width: 100%;font-size: 11px;font-weight: 400;color: #999999;line-height: 16px;" data-mid=""><span leaf="">2026-09-18</span></p></section><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MTM2ODM0ODYyMQ==&mid=2651757098&idx=1&sn=cd31781e4f3ac110928f0b766120d051&scene=21#wechat_redirect" target="_blank" rel=nofollow><span leaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a3d90b9.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1.0026315789473683" data-w="380" style="width: 51px;object-fit: cover;height: 51px !important;background-color: transparent;" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc8a3d90b9.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></span></a></section></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p style="display: none;"><mp-style-type data-value="3"></mp-style-type></p>]]></description>
