><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">热门论文解读</span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">学术新星访谈</span></span></p><span data-mpa-action-id="mqgg35eosx9"></span><section style="text-align: justify;margin: 16px 16px 24px;line-height: 1.75em;" nodeleaf=""><img  data-src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc0f6c2eaf.jpg" class="rich_pages wxw-img" data-ratio="1" data-s="300,640" data-type="jpeg" data-w="1000" style="width:100%;" data-croporisrc="https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/XqAicMdcoiafNYCa1xYqtibdI6KgbS324UWp22nonUj8u96z3noLz36g4GiaxY1E7vOLvRaib5znCbbgj0CUbu3ibibI5nNhbPFPZQ4dOzDuw6k6t4/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg" data-cropselx1="0" data-cropselx2="546" data-cropsely1="0" data-cropsely2="546" data-imgfileid="100259910" data-aistatus="1"  src="https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20260930/6abcc0f6c2eaf.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90"/></section><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span data-eleid="11"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">扫描上方二维码</span></span></span></p><p style="text-align: center;margin-right: 16px;margin-bottom: 8px;margin-left: 16px;line-height: 1.75em;"><span data-eleid="11"><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">或点击</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">「</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">阅读原文</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">」</span></span><span leaf="" style="line-height: 1.75em;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.5px;font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;"><span textstyle="" style="color: #4499E7;font-weight: bold;">关注专区。</span></span></span></p></section></section><section><span data-lark-record-format="docx/record"></span></section><section><span data-mpa-action-id="mipr37w01zjd"></span></section>]]></description>
